  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional and Community Strengthening for Peacebuilding and Stabilization in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at contributing to the implementation of the Peace Agreement and the establishment of a long-lasting peace in Colombia through institutional and community strengthening along three strategic lines.  The project will assist in building sustainable peace and reconciliation, contribute to stabilization, including environmental protection and conservation and strength security and justice.</narrative>
  </description>
